I did successful compile this thing, but I did have a problem
with the util/Makefile (I thought I'd post in case anyone else
is having the same problem).

The "test" command in the Makefile was not known by my system
(HP 425 with HP-UX 8.0).  I was in a rush to get this thing
working, so I didn't really worry about it much -- I commented
the two occurances of this command out.  ie:

[util/Makefile]
#       @test -r lev_lex.o
#       @test -r dgn_lex.o

I assume that they were just testing for the presence of those
two files, and they *were* there, so I think it worked.
